<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<div data-klic-component="file-upload" class="kn-file-upload"><div data-part="file"><i data-part="icon" data-lucide="upload" aria-hidden="true"></i><label for="export-file-upload-default-file">파일 선택</label><input type="file" id="export-file-upload-default-file" multiple data-files data-part="input"><small>로컬 이름·크기만 확인 · 서버 전송 없음</small></div><ul data-file-results data-part="file-results"><li>선택한 파일이 없습니다.</li></ul></div>
